### FrischMarkt – the ONLINE SHOP sends orders to CPI (iFlow FM_01)
### Fill in the 4 values from your service key fm-shop-key (BTP cockpit → Instances → fm-shop-runtime → fm-shop-key).
### Never commit this file with real values to GitHub.
@clientid = PASTE_clientid
@clientsecret = PASTE_clientsecret
@tokenurl = PASTE_tokenurl
@cpiurl = PASTE_url

### 0. Get a visitor badge (OAuth token) at the reception desk
# @name getToken
POST {{tokenurl}}
Authorization: Basic {{clientid}}:{{clientsecret}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials

### 1. Normal order: 2 lines, pickup in Essen → expect 201, status CONFIRMED
POST {{cpiurl}}/http/fm/shop-order
Authorization: Bearer {{getToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ShopOrder": {
    "orderNumber": "WEB-100045",
    "pickupStore": "ESSEN",
    "customer": { "email": "kunde@example.com" },
    "lines": [
      { "sku": "P-2002", "qty": 3 },
      { "sku": "P-4001", "qty": 6 }
    ]
  }
}

### 2. Order with ONE line, pickup in Köln → expect 201 (tests the array setting in the XML-to-JSON converter)
POST {{cpiurl}}/http/fm/shop-order
Authorization: Bearer {{getToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ShopOrder": {
    "orderNumber": "WEB-100046",
    "pickupStore": "KOELN",
    "customer": { "email": "x@example.com" },
    "lines": [
      { "sku": "P-3001", "qty": 2 }
    ]
  }
}

### 3. Too much salmon → the ERP says 409; CPI reports an error (we handle it nicely in Phase 6)
POST {{cpiurl}}/http/fm/shop-order
Authorization: Bearer {{getToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ShopOrder": {
    "orderNumber": "WEB-100047",
    "pickupStore": "ESSEN",
    "customer": { "email": "y@example.com" },
    "lines": [
      { "sku": "P-1001", "qty": 50 }
    ]
  }
}

### 4. Unknown store "BERLIN" → the mapping stops the message (fixValues: throw exception)
POST {{cpiurl}}/http/fm/shop-order
Authorization: Bearer {{getToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ShopOrder": {
    "orderNumber": "WEB-100048",
    "pickupStore": "BERLIN",
    "customer": { "email": "z@example.com" },
    "lines": [
      { "sku": "P-2001", "qty": 1 }
    ]
  }
}
